      "values:originalText": "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 109, 2023\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Repudiation) Act 2023",
      "skos:definition": "Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 109, 2023\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Repudiation) Act 2023",
      "cml:asserts": [
