      "cml:integrityHash": "f6d7c39473fd0472643435efba9daebc0d73399a30f0adf169607d458f67198d",
      "skos:note": "Ceases to be an Australian citizen if decisions overturn or quash citizenship cessation order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-repudiation-act-2023#sch-1-sec-36b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36B(4) Cessation of citizenship if citizenship cessation order made by",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a decision (the first decision) of a court overturning or\nquashing the order made under subsection 36C(1) in relation\nto the person is appealed; and\n\n(b) the decision (the second decision) on appeal overturns or\nquashes the first decision;\nthe person ceases to be an Australian citizen at the time the second\ndecision is made."
    },
